{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "latam", "appid": 924970, "month": "2023-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1677628800, "end_date": 1680307199, "month_true_total": 9, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:55:59 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "135277213", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997788766", "personaname": "ᴛᴏᴍᴍʏ.ᴄʟ™ ☁", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/franchesk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1498, "last_played": 1679687259, "avatar": "3887867fd7b4916c2af457b6788ad42ed1b7a7f4"}, "language": "latam", "review": "deberia ser un precio mas accesible", "timestamp_created": 1679625530, "timestamp_updated": 1679625530, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135192078", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065149711", "personaname": "TheSebas25", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thesebas/", "num_games_owned": 303, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 1349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 237, "last_played": 1774215601, "avatar": "3fd8d1d2b593e53f0eb38ff9fade4e6921cc3aed"}, "language": "latam", "review": "En rebaja y con el modo offline agregado considero que vale la pena.", "timestamp_created": 1679524419, "timestamp_updated": 1679524419, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.609646141529083252", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135078002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008231847", "personaname": "prex23", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/porcorex23/", "num_games_owned": 242, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 318, "last_played": 1762664167, "avatar": "69d5e6211a25739a30535f8d598eb4a25538dda3"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Frenético, sangriento, repleto de acción. Estupendo sonido y gráficos. No entiendo las críticas desmedidas, ni la comparación con el Left 4 Dead. Fue un gran juego, pero esta es una versión mejorada, moderna y mucho más espectacular. Creo que el precio desmedido (lo compré en oferta a 75% de descuento) y los altos requerimientos de hardware hizo que muchos se queden con la versión \"vieja\" y destilen bronca contra este nuevo ¿hijo? ¿primo? del L4D.\nGran juego, muy divertido y recomendable.", "timestamp_created": 1679375441, "timestamp_updated": 1679375441, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502840876579284668", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134977817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198298231809", "personaname": "Umine Zenko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/uminezenko/", "num_games_owned": 672, "num_reviews": 230, "playtime_forever": 504, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 401, "last_played": 1698456843, "avatar": "30bbaa1da57f62c4c43c0d64e7dc94c063ffd0be"}, "language": "latam", "review": "La posta es que es un buen juego, muchos decian que el juego era horrible y que nada que ver con left 4 dead.\nTiene algunos parecidos con el juego anteriormente mencionado, si el back 4 blood no hubiera sido comparado con L4D las reseñas serian todas positivas, no hay que dejar un juego en la mierda solo por que lo hizo la misma empresa pero diferente. Practicamente es un L4D pero con habilidades, muchas habilidades, accesorios para armas (aunque no tantos), skins de armas y personajes que se consiguen gratis, menos 4 de cada personaje que se consigue solo con DLCS.\n\nEs un buen juego si ves una reseña negativa porque no es Left 4 dead 3 no le des bola.", "timestamp_created": 1679241574, "timestamp_updated": 1679241574, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.613917231559753418", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134930474", "author": {"steamid": "76561198443913255", "personaname": "the world is yours 3232", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198443913255/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 305, "last_played": 1638654581, "avatar": "0a77e88260b2ee02043c87d257ff78f541a3feb1"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Back 4 blood es un juego bastante decente como juego, pero que se relacione tanto con left 4 dead 1 y 2 hace que parezca mediocre pero no lo es tanto 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1679189092, "timestamp_updated": 1679189092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528907954692840576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134628991", "author": {"steamid": "76561198314204951", "personaname": "Ale", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AleliNia1207/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever"